      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm working on a spec for a law firm lobby in central London. It's going to get a lot of heavy foot traffic. Can you give me a comparison between polished concrete, LVT, and natural stone? Specifically looking at how they handle scratches, scuffs, and general long-term wear resistance. Thanks.",
